{
 "id": "rsi-overbought-trend-01",
 "title": {
  "en": "RSI Stays Overbought in a Trend",
  "bn": "Trend-এ RSI overbought-ই থাকে"
 },
 "symbol": "EURUSD",
 "timeframe": "H4",
 "mode": "synthetic",
 "type": "pattern",
 "bias": "bullish",
 "outcome": "loss",
 "tags": [
  "rsi",
  "overbought",
  "trend"
 ],
 "module": "07-technical-indicators",
 "lessonSlugs": [
  "02-rsi-divergence"
 ],
 "caption": {
  "en": "RSI crosses 70 early in a strong uptrend and stays high for weeks. A sell at the first 'overbought' reading fights the trend.",
  "bn": "শক্তিশালী uptrend-এর শুরুতেই RSI 70 ছাড়ায় এবং অনেক candle ওপরেই থাকে। প্রথম 'overbought'-এ sell করা মানে trend-এর সঙ্গে লড়াই।"
 },
 "notes": {
  "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
  "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
 },
 "explanation": {
  "en": "Overbought means price rose fast, not that it must fall. In a trend RSI can hold above 70 for a long time.",
  "bn": "Overbought মানে দাম দ্রুত উঠেছে, পড়তেই হবে তা নয়। Trend-এ RSI অনেকক্ষণ 70-এর ওপরে থাকতে পারে।"
 },
 "keyTakeaways": [
  {
   "en": "Overbought is a description, not a sell signal",
   "bn": "Overbought একটি বর্ণনা, sell signal নয়"
  }
 ],
